#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals and reference targets preserved.
#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:84
msgid ""
"Once the installation is complete, the output should indicate \"successfully,\" "
"confirming the installation. The firmware installation method is the same."
msgstr ""
"Uma vez concluída a instalação, a saída deve indicar \"sucessivamente\", confirmando "
"a instalação. O método de instalação do firmware é o mesmo."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals and reference targets preserved.
#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:86
msgid ""
"When Mindie does not start properly, verify that the driver and firmware versions "
"match. Both the driver and firmware must be installed on the host machine and loaded "
"into the Docker container via mounting."
msgstr ""
"Quando Mindie  não inicia corretamente, verifique se as versões do driver e firmware "
"correspondem. Tanto o driver como o firmware devem ser instalados na máquina host e "
"carregados na Docker  recipiente através de montagem."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals and reference targets preserved.
#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:88
msgid "For version upgrades, install the firmware first, then the driver."
msgstr "Para atualizações de versão, instale o firmware primeiro, depois o driver."

